    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ea2b72aa"
      },
      "source": [
        "### **Pricing & Revenue Analysis**\n",
        "checking for transactions with zero or negative prices (which could represent adjustments, bad debts, or gifts) and calculate the overall sales distribution."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "c39e4b5f",
        "outputId": "a505702e-09d6-4267-9134-b8ab6bf02791"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Inspect non-positive prices\n",
        "zero_or_negative_prices = df[df['Price'] <= 0]\n",
        "print(f\"Number of transactions with Price <= 0: {len(zero_or_negative_prices)}\")\n",
        "print(zero_or_negative_prices['Description'].value_counts().head(10))\n",
        "\n",
        "# Create a LineTotal column for revenue analysis (excluding cancellations for accurate revenue stats)\n",
        "df['LineTotal'] = df['Quantity'] * df['Price']\n",
        "valid_sales = df[~df['is_cancelled'] & (df['Quantity'] > 0) & (df['Price'] > 0)]\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Total Revenue Generated: {valid_sales['LineTotal'].sum():,.2f}\")"
      ],
      "execution_count": 28,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Number of transactions with Price <= 0: 3483\n",
            "Description\n",
            "?                               43\n",
            "damaged                         38\n",
            "damages                         37\n",
            "missing                         24\n",
            "checked                          8\n",
            "OWL DOORSTOP                     7\n",
            "POLYESTER FILLER PAD 45x45cm     7\n",
            "given away                       6\n",
            "FLAG OF ST GEORGE CAR FLAG       6\n",
            "dotcom                           6\n",
            "Name: count, dtype: int64\n",
            "Total Revenue Generated: 9,492,431.46\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "52f16ce4"
      },
      "source": [
        "### **Outlier Identification**\n",
        "We will visualize the distribution of `Quantity` and `Price` using boxplots to identify extreme outliers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 418
        },
        "id": "2aec6d95",
        "outputId": "3e2096ec-c269-47f2-b7b5-b0636e617915"
      },
      "source": [
        "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 5))\n",
        "\n",
        "sns.boxplot(data=df, y='Quantity', ax=axes[0])\n",
        "axes[0].set_title('Quantity Distribution (with Outliers)')\n",
        "\n",
        "sns.boxplot(data=df, y='Price', ax=axes[1])\n",
        "axes[1].set_title('Price Distribution (with Outliers)')\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "execution_count": 29,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "display_data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "<Figure size 1400x500 with 2 Axes>"
            ],
            "image/png": "\n"
          },
          "metadata": {}
        }
      ]
    },
