      "source": [
        "## **Monthly Revenue Trends**\n",
        "To understand the business growth cycle, we will group our valid sales transactions by month and plot the monthly total revenue trend."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 487
        },
        "id": "f4edc316",
        "outputId": "8cc7ce23-512e-4e65-ea3a-40ddef83e1af"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Group valid sales by Year-Month and calculate sum of LineTotal\n",
        "monthly_revenue = valid_sales.groupby('YearMonth')['LineTotal'].sum().reset_index()\n",
        "monthly_revenue['YearMonth'] = monthly_revenue['YearMonth'].dt.to_timestamp()\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.figure(figsize=(12, 5))\n",
        "sns.lineplot(data=monthly_revenue, x='YearMonth', y='LineTotal', marker='o', color='b')\n",
        "plt.title('Monthly Revenue Trend (Excluding Cancellations)')\n",
        "plt.xlabel('Month')\n",
        "plt.ylabel('Total Revenue (£)')\n",
        "plt.grid(True, linestyle='--')\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "execution_count": 31,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "display_data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
              "<Figure size 1200x500 with 1 Axes>"
            ],
            "image/png": "\n"
          },
          "metadata": {}
        }
      ]
    },
