    "# 1.0 Exploratory Data Analysis \u2014 Raw Dataset Audit (Pre-Cleaning)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Project:** Retail E-Commerce \u2014 Customer Segmentation & Churn Prediction (`Retail-Ecommerce--CSCP`)  \n",
    "**Author:** Aman Singh  \n",
    "**Source File:** `data/raw/online_retail_II.csv`\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Raw Dataset Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook documents the initial inspection and quality audit of the raw **`online_retail_II.csv`** dataset **before any cleaning or transformation is applied**.\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Origin:** UCI Machine Learning Repository \u2014 *Online Retail II* transactional log.\n",
    "- **Business Context:** Real transactional records from a UK-based non-store online retailer selling all-occasion giftware. The customer base consists of both individual retail shoppers and B2B wholesale buyers.\n",
    "- **Granularity:** Each row represents a single product line item within an order (one invoice typically spans multiple rows).\n",
    "- **Goal of Pre-Cleaning Analysis:** Inspect schema, data types, memory usage, summary distributions, duplicates, missing values, cancellations, non-merchandise codes, and temporal coverage to design a safe, evidence-based cleaning strategy.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Feature Dictionary (Raw Schema)\n",
    "\n",
    "| Column Name | Raw Type | Description | Known Raw Characteristics & Risks |\n",
    "| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n",
    "| **`Invoice`** | String (`str`) | 6-digit transaction number | Prefix `'C'` marks a cancellation/credit note; `'A'` marks bad-debt ledger adjustments. |\n",
    "| **`StockCode`** | String (`str`) | Product SKU identifier | Mostly 5-digit codes (plus letter variants like `85099B`), alongside non-product codes (`POST`, `DOT`, `M`, `BANK CHARGES`). |\n",
    "| **`Description`** | String (`str`) | Item name / description | Contains missing values, trailing/multiple spaces, and internal warehouse status notes (`check`, `damages`). |\n",
    "| **`Quantity`** | Integer (`int64`) | Units per transaction line | Negative values occur for customer returns (`C` invoices) and warehouse stock write-offs. |\n",
    "| **`InvoiceDate`** | String (`str`) | Order timestamp (`YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS`) | Stored as string; needs datetime parsing for chronological and recency calculations. |\n",
    "| **`Price`** | Float (`float64`) | Unit price in GBP (\u00a3) | Contains zero-price warehouse entries and negative bad-debt accounting adjustments. |\n",
    "| **`Customer ID`** | Float (`float64`) | 5-digit customer identifier | Stored as float because of `NaN` values; missing on guest checkouts and internal adjustments. |\n",
    "| **`Country`** | String (`str`) | Customer's country | Heavily concentrated in the United Kingdom alongside 42 international markets. |"
   ]
